[ti:Dear Zoo]
[al:lesson l14]
[offset:0]
[00:00.00]I wrote to the zoo to send me a pet.
[00:15.02]They sent me an elephant.
[00:22.56]He was too big! I sent him back.
[00:28.98]So they sent me a giraffe.
[00:36.94]He was too tall! I sent him back.
[00:43.72]So they sent me a lion.
[00:51.92]He was too fierce! I sent him back.
[00:58.50]So they sent me a camel.
[01:06.72]He was too grumpy! I sent him back.
[01:15.12]So they sent me a snake.
[01:23.34]He was too scary! I sent him back.
[01:29.92]So they sent me a monkey.
[01:37.84]He was too naughty! I sent him back.
[01:44.74]So they sent me a frog.
[01:52.54]He was too jumpy! I sent him back.
[02:01.50]So they thought very hard, and sent me a dog.
[02:15.08]He was perfect! I kept him.
